cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this registry, please cite it using the metadata below.
  When you use a listed resource, also cite that resource's own paper or dataset page.
type: dataset
title: "Somali AI & NLP Resources Registry"
version: "2026-10-26"
abstract: >-
  A registry of publicly documented Somali artificial intelligence and natural
  language processing resources (text corpora, speech datasets, translation
  resources, classification datasets, language models, and evaluation sets).
  It records metadata and links to original sources and does not host
  third-party datasets or models. The 2026-10-26 snapshot lists 35
  Somali-focused resources identified in a scoping survey.
authors:
  # Full name kept as one unit so citation tools do not shorten it to "Mohamud, M. M."
  - name: "Muad Mohamed Mohamud"
repository-code: "https://github.com/moadjini/somali-ai-nlp-registry"
url: "https://github.com/moadjini/somali-ai-nlp-registry"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - Somali
  - natural language processing
  - low-resource languages
  - language resources
  - speech recognition
  - machine translation
  - resource registry
